# Glassmorphism UI — E-SUKET

Semua UI baru dan refactor visual **wajib** mengikuti gaya ini.

## Gaya Utama: Glassmorphism

- `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` + `-webkit-backdrop-filter`
- Background putih semi-transparan: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6)`
- Border putih tipis: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35)`
- Shadow lembut: `0 8px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)`
- Elemen terlihat mengambang di atas latar gradien

## Token Warna (gunakan `var()`, jangan hex hardcode)

| Token | Nilai | Pemakaian |
|-------|-------|-----------|
| `--rumput-teal` | `#14b8a6` | Tombol primary, link aktif, ikon interaktif |
| `--rumput-teal-dark` | `#0d9488` | Hover, teks aksen |
| `--rumput-teal-light` | `#2dd4bf` | Gradien, highlight |
| `--rumput-teal-muted` | `rgba(20,184,166,.12)` | Hover background |
| `--rumput-glass-bg` | `rgba(255,255,255,.6)` | Card, navbar, container |
| `--rumput-ink` | `#0f172a` | Teks utama (kontras WCAG) |
| `--rumput-ink-muted` | `#475569` | Teks sekunder |

## Class Utilitas (sudah tersedia di `_theme.scss`)

```html
<body class="rumput-glass-body">
<div class="card glass-card">...</div>
<nav class="glass-navbar">...</nav>
<div class="card-header glass-accent">...</div>
```

## Bootstrap

- `$primary` = teal — pakai `btn-primary`, `text-primary`, `bg-primary`
- Grid & utilities Bootstrap 5 tetap diprioritaskan
- Card default: tambahkan `glass` atau `glass-card`
- Responsif: mobile-first, test di `< 992px`

## Pola Blade

```blade
{{-- ✅ BENAR --}}
<div class="card glass-card border-0 rounded-4">
  <div class="card-header glass-accent">Judul</div>
  <div class="card-body text-dark">...</div>
</div>
<a class="btn btn-primary"><i class="ri-add-line"></i> Ajukan</a>

{{-- ❌ SALAH --}}
<div class="card" style="background:#AEA07A">
<div style="background-color:#7896B2">
```

## Latar Belakang Body

Layout utama pakai `class="rumput-glass-body"` — gradien putih/abu + sentuhan tosca. Jangan override dengan `background: #fff` solid pada `body` atau `.main`.

## Aksesibilitas

- Teks pada glass: minimal `--rumput-ink` (#0f172a), hindari abu terlalu muda di atas glass
- Tombol/teal on white: kontras cukup; teks putih hanya di atas `glass-accent` atau `btn-primary`
- Focus ring: `box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--rumput-teal-muted)`
- Touch target mobile: min 44px (sudah di `mobile-responsive-pro.css`)

## Migrasi Warna Lama

Ganti saat menyentuh file:
- `#AEA07A`, `#AB9C71`, `#B6A16B` → `var(--rumput-teal)` atau `glass-accent`
- `#7896B2`, `#376C9D` → `var(--rumput-teal-dark)`
- Card putih solid → `glass-card`

## SCSS

- Token baru → `_theme.scss`; override Bootstrap → `_variables.scss`
- Komponen layout admin → `_sidebar.scss`
- Jangan duplikasi token; extend class `.glass*` yang ada
